{'symbol': 'MAA', 'date': '2022-09-27 16:15:00', 'title': 'MAA ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY COMMON DIVIDEND', 'text': 'GERMANTOWN, TENN. , SEPT. 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MAA (NYSE: MAA)\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS APPROVED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYMENT OF $1.25 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK TO BE PAID ON OCTOBER 31, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON OCTOBER 14, 2022.'}